WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sam Rep: Marcus, Elena, thanks for making time. I wanted to walk through where we landed on the proposal I sent two weeks ago.

2
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Marcus Webb: Honestly we have not had time to look at the proposal properly. It has been a very busy month for the whole operations team.

3
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:38.000
Elena Ruiz: I should be upfront. Budget is frozen until January, so I cannot approve anything this quarter no matter how good the product is.

4
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:50.000
Marcus Webb: We are also talking to another vendor who is cheaper than you. I am not saying we will go with them, but it is on the table.

5
00:00:50.500 --> 00:01:02.000
Sam Rep: That is fair. Would it help if I sent a one page summary of the return on investment that you can share with your leadership?

6
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:14.000
Marcus Webb: Maybe. Let me think about it and check with my team before we decide whether to keep going.

7
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:22.000
Sam Rep: Sounds good. I will send the one page summary tomorrow morning.
